-0.0773,"r20_sector":0.1359,"etf":"XLC"}}],"quotes":[{"c":"IRDM 2019 Q2","e":"irdm","d":"2019-07-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas J. Fitzpatrick","x":"The first half of the year has come in much as we would have expected, which gives us comfort in reaffirming our full year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/23/iridium-communications-inc-irdm-q2-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"IRDM 2019 Q2","e":"irdm","d":"2019-07-23","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Hamed Khorsand","x":"It still seems like you're just reluctant to increase guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/23/iridium-communications-inc-irdm-q2-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"IRDM 2019 Q3","e":"irdm","d":"2019-10-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Matthew J. Desch","x":"Once aviation terminals are ready we expect Iridium Certus to turbocharge our existing suite of aircraft Safety Services as well as deliver Internet capabilities such as electronic flight bag services graphic weather black box streaming email and more.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/iridium-communications-inc-irdm-q3-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"IRDM 2019 Q3","e":"irdm","d":"2019-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Mathieu Robilliard","x":"And I was wondering why you weren't raising the guidance on EBITDA?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/29/iridium-communications-inc-irdm-q3-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"IRDM 2020 Q1","e":"irdm","d":"2020-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew J. Desch","x":"I mean that's coming right in line, by the way, with Inmarsat who is raising prices soon on all their Inmarsat fleet customers, which are primarily their GMDSS customers and they're creating a minimum revenue commitment per month per terminals that historically haven't charged anything.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/28/iridium-communications-inc-irdm-q1-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"IRDM 2020 Q1","e":"irdm","d":"2020-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew J. Desch","x":"So you can imagine from a competitive environment, we are in a very positive position in that we're not raising prices on our customers right at their most vulnerable time as our primary competitor is doing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/28/iridium-communications-inc-irdm-q1-2020-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"IRDM 2020 Q3","e":"irdm","d":"2020-10-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matthew J. Desch","x":"Now based on our performance, through the first three quarters of the year, we are raising our full year guidance for service revenue growth and operational EBITDA.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/20/iridium-communications-inc-irdm-q3-2020-earnings-c/"},{"c":"IRDM 2020 Q3","e":"irdm","d":"2020-10-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas J. Fitzpatrick","x":"I'll get started by summarizing our key financial metrics for the quarter and providing some color on the trends we're seeing in our business lines, which give us confidence in raising our full year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/20/iridium-communications-inc-irdm-q3-2020-earnings-c/"},{"c":"IRDM 2021 Q1","e":"irdm","d":"2021-04-20","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Matthew J. Desch","x":"If you can give me more speed and faster connection, where you go IT instead of -- IP, excuse me, instead of sort of the mechanism we sort of had before, I can see sending pictures and data and sort of streaming things and that sort of thing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/20/iridium-communications-inc-irdm-q1-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"IRDM 2021 Q1","e":"irdm","d":"2021-04-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas J. Fitzpatrick","x":"As a result, we continue to reiterate our full year guidance for service revenue growth of approximately 3%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/20/iridium-communications-inc-irdm-q1-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"IRDM 2021 Q2","e":"irdm","d":"2021-07-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thomas J. Fitzpatrick","x":"We are also having to absorb some price increases that could compress equipment margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/20/iridium-communications-inc-irdm-q2-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"IRDM 2021 Q2","e":"irdm","d":"2021-07-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matthew J. Desch","x":"When you say pricing, do you mean raising prices?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/20/iridium-communications-inc-irdm-q2-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"IRDM 2021 Q2","e":"irdm","d":"2021-07-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas J. Fitzpatrick","x":"Due to the uncertainty with supplier constraints and the resulting impact on equipment revenues and costs and given the softer engineering revenue we now expect, we have not increased our guidance for operational EBITDA.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/20/iridium-communications-inc-irdm-q2-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"IRDM 2021 Q2","e":"irdm","d":"2021-07-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas J. Fitzpatrick","x":"We reiterate our full year guidance for EBITDA of between $365 million and $375 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/20/iridium-communications-inc-irdm-q2-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"IRDM 2021 Q3","e":"irdm","d":"2021-10-19","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas J. Fitzpatrick","x":"I'll get started by summarizing our key financial metrics for the quarter and providing some color on the trends we're seeing in our business lines, which give us confidence in raising our full-year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/19/iridium-communications-inc-irdm-q3-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"IRDM 2021 Q3","e":"irdm","d":"2021-10-19","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas J. Fitzpatrick","x":"In light of this strength, we are raising our outlook for EBITDA to approximately $375 million this fiscal year based upon expectations that service revenue will increase between 5% and 6% in 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/19/iridium-communications-inc-irdm-q3-2021-earnings-c/"},{"c":"IRDM 2022 Q1","e":"irdm","d":"2022-04-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matt Desch","x":"I think if anything, they're kind of not being more aggressive, maybe there's been price increases and other things on their side that have kind of indicated that maybe they're even struggling for some growth, but I think they're doing OK in the environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/19/iridium-communications-irdm-q1-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"IRDM 2022 Q1","e":"irdm","d":"2022-04-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matt Desch","x":"And I'd say this is a little bit of rightsizing for the growth that we're seeing right now and where we're at.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/19/iridium-communications-irdm-q1-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"IRDM 2022 Q1","e":"irdm","d":"2022-04-19","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matt Desch","x":"These investments are among the reasons that we're not raising our full-year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/19/iridium-communications-irdm-q1-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"IRDM 2022 Q1","e":"irdm","d":"2022-04-19","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Fitzpatrick","x":"Accordingly, we reiterate our outlook for operational EBITDA between $400 million and $410 million in 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/19/iridium-communications-irdm-q1-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"IRDM 2022 Q2","e":"irdm","d":"2022-07-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Fitzpatrick","x":"Now I'll recap our increased guidance for 2022 and close with a review of our liquidity position and capital structure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/26/iridium-communications-irdm-q2-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"IRDM 2022 Q2","e":"irdm","d":"2022-07-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Fitzpatrick","x":"These trends give us confidence in raising our full year outlook to better reflect the ongoing demand for our L-band services, which we expect to continue in the second half of the year and drive incremental subscriber growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/26/iridium-communications-irdm-q2-2022-earnings-call/"},{"c":"IRDM 2024 Q3","e":"irdm","d":"2024-10-17","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matt Desch","x":"I had, I said we had a strong quarter in the third quarter with revenue so the subscribers, and that allowed us to as we look into the Q4 to be able to raise the guidance to the midpoint of the guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/10/iridium-irdm-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IRDM 2024 Q4","e":"irdm","d":"2025-02-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matt Desch","x":"This allows them to streamline workflows between flight planners and pilots and optimize flight paths and maintenance services to inform and enhance flight operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/10/iridium-irdm-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IRDM 2025 Q1","e":"irdm","d":"2025-04-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Matt Desch","x":"The new tariff levels announced a few weeks ago that were implemented and then largely suspended have created more uncertainty than we had anticipated, particularly around equipment expense.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/10/iridium-irdm-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IRDM 2025 Q1","e":"irdm","d":"2025-04-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Matt Desch","x":"In the current environment, we will be expanding this relationship quickly to mitigate as much of the new tariff costs as we can, utilizing it for almost all non-U.S. partner shipments, which is about 75% of the total.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/10/iridium-irdm-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IRDM 2025 Q1","e":"irdm","d":"2025-04-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matt Desch","x":"A year or two ago, we decided instead of having like price increases every five years, a smaller price increase every 2.5 years, would be less noticeable really by the market and sort of in line with global inflation sort of things that are happening anyway.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/10/iridium-irdm-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IRDM 2025 Q1","e":"irdm","d":"2025-04-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matt Desch","x":"If we would have told them that there’d be a big price increase or something on hardware later this year, we might have changed that, but I don’t think that’s really the direction we wanted to be going.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/10/iridium-irdm-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IRDM 2025 Q1","e":"irdm","d":"2025-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matt Desch","x":"Between the new tariffs and U.S. government rightsizing and shifting priorities, we expect to see impact on our industry, some potentially positive as space remains a priority right now, but some negative as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/10/iridium-irdm-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"IRDM 2025 Q2","e":"irdm","d":"2025-07-24","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Matthew J. Desch","x":"…current administration's priorities such as Golden Dome, the growing threats in the INDO-PACOM theater and the U.S. government's growing recognition of the importance of commercial space, we remain well positioned for growth, especially given our unique network and our